{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30018_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:36964ddeeae6664f30d04b2d7849c96f3b2837fa44bf72b5108b5b18addda033",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b578e324468235fbe4051090c5580d0eb07601770bc21fc1acb94d8ea9a21655",
      "text": "早上好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09659eff3eceed65968ea8fa8abb59e08a18bc0ce5e2f0ddcac7a098cee7073d",
      "text": "Jupiter的各位，早上好！\n今天一整天，请多多关照啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8db5a8ff54e0de8244df2f4ffca6c8ce9fe520146371b7c61a1b063e07f067eb",
      "text": "哎呀，来了啊。哎呀～\nJupiter能来参加，真是太让人高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56bf5896bce30fcd04122c925539b25d072bd70d098919dfc2587ffb1d64b83b",
      "text": "我们这边才要感谢您给我们这么宝贵的机会！\n今天请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e030a1b31f1c7c4e951e5feecf01b818af019ba167f19f39120d96d3cf9a1fc5",
      "text": "嗯，很期待你们有趣的谈话哦～！\n那么，我们马上进入准备阶段吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000067:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0e55c818bd0a2eaf58240100cc84cd24592064ba96b8a322bef162dc240adc2",
      "text": "广播正式录制……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbf4e2c1d36a88e601c568c516153846473accce8440586d631a8490b4e3b127",
      "text": "好的，那么……今天我们邀请到了Jupiter的三位\n作为嘉宾来做客！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce2cad6b806760c0db66387f0647cf1d3697eff7de7f2c6304b85a3f382d3f4f",
      "text": "三位看起来都状态绝佳呢～。前些天的广告\n我也看了哦。大家真是帅得不行啊～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cd898a132e9414d3fa57a12fadcf48f69f9a16e580392d8fd4317abcac9baea",
      "text": "哈哈哈，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b24e5fa21e363ce763f6d15b2b3444316a5449fa24f4054e0a9eda385d4855e6",
      "text": "看来努力上课没有白费呢～！\n冬马君之前可是相当吃力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9ebf0ee586782c636b99676ec8552f1bb39ce2f1b758633f72410d5b1a7c340",
      "text": "最开始明明还说什么“小菜一碟啦”，\n结果一开课整个人就一直绷得死死的呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30018_01:1_3_30018_01_f:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea757fa89d2cb4ea58afcd7265e23b0a25ec6a054af6265f8e8abe48f000debe",
      "text": "喂、喂！翔太你在得到北斗的建议\n之前，不也一样苦战了半天嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
